        "original_id": "605b7a28-f228-5c20-ab3a-58890736d18b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robbie Tucker, Max Ehrich, Fenmore Baldwin\n- Products: Criminal Minds, FlashForward, It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia\n- Concepts: The Gang\n- Places: Paddy's Pub, South Philadelphia\n\nFacts:\n- Robbie Tucker was born on April 5, 2001, and he is an American actor.\n- Robbie Tucker appeared on the series Criminal Minds, FlashForward, and It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia.\n- It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia follows The Gang, a group of debauched, self-centered friends who run the Irish bar Paddy's Pub in South Philadelphia.\n- Fenmore Baldwin was initially portrayed by various child actors, including Robbie Tucker.\n- In 2012, Fenmore Baldwin was rapidly aged to a teenager, and Max Ehrich assumed the role.",
